<slide>
  theme: terminal
</slide>

<h2>A custom theme: <c>terminal</c></h2>

<p>
  Green on black, with token colors to match. Change a theme and the code
  tokens recolor, because they are just CSS variables.
</p>

<code lang=bash id=g1>
  <frame>
    $ slides dev my-talk/
      ready in 312 ms
  </frame>
  <frame>
    $ slides build my-talk/ -t single
      wrote my-talk.html (3.8 MB)
  </frame>
</code>
